Application 26/01432/FUL is for a two-storey rear extension at 27 Station Road. It is currently under consideration.

Key dates:
- **Consultation closes: 2 October 2026.** This is the deadline for neighbours to submit comments.
- **Decision due: 30 October 2026.**

As a neighbour, you can comment on the proposal before 2 October. Comments should be based on planning matters such as privacy, overshadowing, daylight, visual impact and character. I can't give a formal opinion on whether the extension should be approved; that decision will be made by the council.

If you'd like to know more about the relevant guidance, I can search the council's policy on extensions, or check whether the property has any constraints such as a conservation area or listed building status.
